WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:02.040
No te dejaré hacer esto.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.080
Veronica, listen to me.

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:05.680
The company needs this money

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:07.080
to cover financial gaps.

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:08.800
Go to hell, Mason.

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:11.320
You mean nothing to this family.

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:13.240
And you're even not my real husband.

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:14.920
And you will never be.

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:16.040
Never!

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:18.000
I don't care.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.080
You can live your life

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:19.920
however you want.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:21.240
This is just business.

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:31.240
More!

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:34.360
Okay, give it to me.

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:36.400
I think you've had enough for tonight.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:37.920
Maybe it's time to slow down.

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:39.480
Anthony.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.800
Your job

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:45.000
was to come here,

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.760
not to lecture me.

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:49.200
Their “happy marriage”

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.080
didn't even last year.

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:53.480
While Mason Powell is working

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:54.720
like a dog,

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:56.520
it seems Aspen is losing

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:57.720
the run of herself.

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:01.280
Oh, and here we go.

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:03.680
Mason Powell himself.

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:06.280
Grab your popcorn.

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:08.520
It's about to get interesting.
